+
+// ManageProject may change the project roles of its members.
+type ManageProject interface {
+	WriteProject
+	// Members lists the project members, sorted by user ID.
+	Members() []Member
+	// SetRoles changes the roles of several members at once. Every user ID must
+	// already be a member (else 400) and every role must be valid (else 400).
+	// The whole batch is applied atomically: if any change breaks a model
+	// invariant (for example, demoting a contributor who is assigned a task)
+	// the call fails with 400 and nothing changes. On success it returns the
+	// members after the change.
